# app/graph_src/ is a maintainer-only nested clone of the private graph
# content repo (structure + RU/EN source text) — the Dockerfile only ever
# COPYs app/ into the image, and the running app serves the graph from the
# already-built app/static/graph.json, never from graph_src/ itself. Keep
# it out of the build context: it doesn't belong in the image (adds no
# runtime value, just bloats layers and ships a private repo's .git/remote
# URL into every container).
app/graph_src/
